1. Product Definition

Core Product

* Define Atlas as an AI-powered software engineering learning ecosystem
* Define engineering-first learning philosophy
* Define learning-by-building approach
* Define AI as mentor rather than answer generator
* Define portfolio-driven learning
* Define engineering missions

Product Differentiators

* Adaptive Learning Engine concept
* Engineering Mission Engine
* Guide Mode
* Simplify Mode
* Progressive Hint System
* Secure Execution Platform
* AI Mentor / Atlas Senior Engineer concept
* Engineering Progression System
* Engineering Passport
* Engineering Talent Network concept
* Engineering Story Universe concept
* Engineering Thinking Canvas concept

⸻

2. MVP Scope

MVP — IN SCOPE

* Authentication
* Dashboard
* Learning Paths
* Lessons
* Mission Engine
* Simplify Mode
* Guide Mode
* Hint System
* Code Editor
* Compiler / Execution
* Hidden Tests
* XP / Progression
* Portfolio
* AI Review
* Admin Panel

These are explicitly identified as MVP scope in the PRD.

MVP — OUT OF SCOPE

* Team Collaboration
* Hiring Platform
* Live Competitions
* Marketplace
* Voice Mentor
* Mobile Applications

These remain future phases unless the MVP scope is intentionally changed.

