4. Authentication

Authentication Methods

Email / Password

* Registration
* Login
* Logout
* Forgot password
* Reset password
* Email verification
* Password validation
* Session handling

Google OAuth

* Google Cloud project/credentials page configured
* OAuth Client ID exists
* Existing OAuth application: Atlas Web
* Verify Client ID is used by backend
* Add Google Client ID to backend/.env
* Add Google Client Secret to backend/.env
* Configure authorized redirect URI
* Test Google login end-to-end
* Verify user record is created
* Verify session is created
* Verify logout
* Verify existing-account linking behavior

GitHub OAuth

* GitHub OAuth application created
* Application name: Atlas
* Homepage URL configured for local frontend
* Callback URL configured
* Verify callback URL exactly matches backend callback
* Get GitHub Client ID
* Get GitHub Client Secret
* Add credentials to backend/.env
* Test GitHub login
* Test callback
* Test user creation
* Test existing-account linking
* Test logout/session

Current GitHub Issue

Current browser error:

The redirect_uri is not associated with this application.

Therefore:

* Fix GitHub OAuth callback mismatch
* Ensure frontend/backend URLs match actual running environment
* Re-test GitHub login

